cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template, its characters or its rendering pipeline in research or creative work, please cite it as below."
title: "Touhou, Drawn in Code: a template for making a voiced Touhou Project fan explainer video in pure JavaScript and Canvas 2D"
abstract: "An open-source template that produces a fully voiced fan explainer video with no image assets and no AI-generated art. A deterministic Canvas 2D frame engine renders each frame as a pure function of time; 14 procedurally drawn paper-cut chibi characters share one specification; voice-over is synthesized with AquesTalk and music is arranged from character themes; a headless renderer pipes frames to ffmpeg."
type: software
authors:
